      "subtitle": "Clinical Foundations",
      "learn": [
        "what blood pressure measures",
        "what systolic and diastolic mean",
        "when a reading counts as high",
        "how to keep it healthy"
      ],
      "narration": "In this video, we're going to talk about blood pressure and its two numbers. [pause] By the end, you'll know what blood pressure measures, what systolic and diastolic mean, when a reading counts as high, and how to keep it healthy."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "kicker": "Why it matters",
      "narration": "Most people with high blood pressure feel perfectly well, with no warning signs at all. [pause] Yet inside, the pressure can stay high for years. The World Health Organization estimates that 46 percent of them don't know it. So how would you know?",
