      "kicker": "Taking a reading",
      "narration": "To measure it, an inflatable cuff goes around the upper arm. It squeezes the arm, and a monitor shows two numbers. The top number is the systolic pressure, here 120. The bottom number is the diastolic, here 80. We say this reading is 120 over 80.",
